# The app reads its posts from `content/blog`, so it needs no environment
# variables to build or run. This file is here for when that stops being true.
#
# ".env" is gitignored; copy this to ".env" when you add something. The schema
# in "/src/env.js" should be updated to match.

# Example:
# SERVERVAR="foo"
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLIENTVAR="bar"
